!Sample_data_processing = Methylation calls were extracted as the ratio of the number of Cs over the total number of Cs and Ts using the Bismark_methylation_extractor. CGs were filtered to have a minimum sequencing depth of 5X.
!Sample_data_processing = genome build: hg38, mm10, oryCun2, canFam3, bosTau8, susScr11, galGal6
!Sample_data_processing = processed data files format and content: We provide IGV files containing methylation scores for all CGs with at least 5X sequencing depth.
!Sample_platform_id = GPL23499
